    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration (Murex pecten (Venus comb murex) & Chicoreus ramosus (ramose murex / Muricidae))",
        "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration faithfully reproduces Murex pecten (Venus comb murex) & Chicoreus ramosus (ramose murex / Muricidae) morphology" ;
