    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Murex pecten (Venus comb murex) & Chicoreus ramosus (ramose murex / Muricidae) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 48.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Murex pecten (Venus comb murex) & Chicoreus ramosus (ramose murex / Muricidae)" ;
