<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration — MorphoEval overall 48.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py` (consensus score 52.7/100). The v1 script evaluates a 1D primary spine profile along the *Murex pecten* siphonal canal (L=67.2 mm), but omits the Kirchhoff-Clebsch elastica + unilateral foundation solver, omits tubular self-contact closure vs open-gutter flaring, omits 2-stage and 3-stage secondary/tertiary fractal frond serrations (*Chicoreus ramosus*, k_2/k_1 ≈ 3.8), omits episodic triradiate varix whorl accretion (120 deg phase locking), omits 10-species cross-taxa validation, and lacks computer-vision comb segmentation of the vendored *Murex pecten* specimen. Overall 48.7/100 (faithfulness 41.7, reproducibility 65.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling.py at HEAD, image/png, 122209 B, 1540×630 px, artifact_sha256 c5fc2150eeb3abe51de8b5c2f36957750d21dc8e15071cfc9760415d2d23dccb (sha256 c5fc2150eeb3abe51de8b5c2f36957750d21dc8e15071cfc9760415d2d23dccb), spec_fingerprint 2b94e7a03cd347db53de50ca64fa7292e03536c1d004ec54908d722b5d7edd8a. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2b94e7a03cd347db53de50ca64fa7292e03536c1d004ec54908d722b5d7edd8a; artifact_sha256: c5fc2150eeb3abe51de8b5c2f36957750d21dc8e15071cfc9760415d2d23dccb; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling_reference.json=c73e5d2ac5c13cd5..., datasets/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling/murex_pecten_aperture_specimen.jpg=2f87d4ec30ebec6a..., datasets/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling/paper_citations.bib=fc39398ba54f69e1..., datasets/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling/scout_manifest.json=53cb565add07b28d...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--E`, `--K-s`, `--gamma-varix`, `--h2-ratio`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`, `--verify-only`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 3D episodic varix & frond growth GIF.",
        "remediation needed: Implement a hierarchical 2-stage and 3-stage Kirchhoff-Clebsch elastica + unilateral foundation solver reproducing both *Murex pecten* slender tubular comb spines (16 primary spines along the siphonal canal, gamma >= gamma_fold sealing the hollow base) and *Chicoreus ramosus* multi-generational frondose secondary/tertiary serrations (k_2/k_1 ≈ 3.8, k_3/k_1 ≈ 8.43).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/mollusc_aperture_spine_buckling/` at runtime, validate primary spine count and secondary/primary wavenumber ratio k_2/k_1 across 10 empirical muricid species (r > 0.99), and perform OpenCV/SciPy Difference-of-Gaussians comb-spine periodicity extraction on the vendored *Murex pecten* specimen (`murex_pecten_aperture_specimen.jpg`).",
        "remediation needed: Simulate the episodic varix growth cycle gamma(phi) alternating smooth inter-varix shell secretion (gamma <= gamma_c -> A_spine = 0) with three triradiate varix spine bursts per whorl (120 deg angular phase locking), alongside an explicit subcritical growth negative control (gamma = 0.96 < gamma_c)." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.87e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-moulton-mollusc-aperture-spine-buckling-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Moulton, Goriely & Chirat (2015) & Chirat et al. (2013) hierarchical mollusc aperture spine folding and fractal frond serration — Parameter expressivity: 45/100" ;
